            <h2>Interventions</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Mission Buniyaad targets improvement across all three crucial aspects of education, which whereby comprise of:</p>
          <ul class="list">
            <li><strong>Digital Access:</strong> Enable digital infrastructure for 10 lakh girls (Grades 8–12) across all districts.</li>
            <li><strong>Adaptive Learning:</strong> Scale personalized, tech-enabled learning for girl students.</li>
            <li><strong>Learning Outcomes:</strong> Improve academic performance—+8% in Grades 8, 9, 11; +4% in board exams (Grades 10, 12).</li>
            <li><strong>On-Site Support:</strong> Deploy Karuna Fellows to assist implementation statewide.</li>
            <li><strong>Teacher &amp; Governance Strengthening: </strong>Train teachers and enhance monitoring at district and block levels.</li>
            <li><strong>Community Mobilization:</strong> Promote awareness and support for girls' education.</li>
            <li><strong>Virtual Field Support:</strong> Set up state-level digital support for ICT and education initiatives.</li>
          </ul>
